{"title":"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many right triangles have integer leg lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and a hypotenuse of length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/91927ed6d1093e6ce84e3aa8446121218cb17b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6ee471353554c85f49d41b13eb5ba2c1014a3ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/a/5eaded88bc7fc05e471d0c8b32561eb489d524b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 6\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 7\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 8\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 9\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the Pythagorean theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/973a8939118c8de617a5aad4ecde6cee698d1893.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2=b^2+2b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"163\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c5d2cba02e7ac6845cb3d69a3abcff2cab25dd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2=2b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4e4cf9642b7481b099068513a4bc3e5aa9cebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6ee471353554c85f49d41b13eb5ba2c1014a3ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9698c992334be77221be8c8c819909eca34fde9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> is odd and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is odd, since the right side of the equation is odd. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9b30259d95f64f9aa7c6bd36e1583618a23c8bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> is even. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7bab166b1bf63295915a2f57e58d8621b18f30e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> is odd.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/7/6177312dcb9668853e94115e686eabfdeff9bc69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1,3,5,7,9,11,13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"166\" height=\"17\" />, but if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/4/fc43f0ea59e862d7db01586894e9eea730d427b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/2/902de20183a6f05cfb14adb25de84b5a28348a35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\neq1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f2e696c7d3071c0187e7e04fbacd4b571f68eec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3,5,7,9,11,13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"146\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~qkddud (edited by aopsthedude and bburubburu)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/euz1azVKUYs?t=135\">https://youtu.be/euz1azVKUYs?t=135</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B\">2008 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2008 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a 